id=phoneserver
name=Phone Data Server
version=1.3.0
versionCode=10030
author=Kairo
description=Expose device telemetry (battery, CPU, GPU, memory, storage, thermal, network, Wi-Fi, processes, packages) as JSON over a RESTful HTTP API, plus periodic POST push to your own cloud endpoint. Includes a WebUI in the manager (open the module card, press WebUI), and a browser dashboard on the listen port. Action button shows status + token. Also keeps a local SQLite history (queryable over /api/v1/history*) and serves GET-only screenshots as webp.